%% title: From adding an event to everyone seeing it
%% desc: The Admin adds one event, or brings events in from government holidays, a file or last year. An event stays a draft or is published. Everyone sees published events by their role and can subscribe on their phone.
flowchart LR
  A["Add one<br/>by one"]:::admin --> D["Draft"]:::note
  G["Government<br/>holidays"]:::admin --> D
  F["From a file"]:::admin --> D
  C["Copy from<br/>last year"]:::admin --> D
  D -->|publish| P["Published"]
  P --> V["Everyone sees it<br/>by their role"]:::guardian
  P --> M["Phone<br/>calendar app"]:::teacher
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
